VulkanFluid
  build.c                    c build static library
  fld/core/                  public types and high-level scene state
  fld/material/              physical liquid and solid contact properties
  fld/math/                  numerical helpers
  fld/simulation/            GPU particle solver and neighbor search
  fld/surface/               surface/topology treatment (as needed)
  fld/porous/                deferred
  fld/render/                optical surface reconstruction
  fld/shaders/               Vulkan compute and rendering shaders

This branch intentionally contains NO legacy liquid simulation.
Physical property helpers are the first verified implementation component;
the high-performance GPU solver and renderer are NOT implemented yet.
Main is unchanged until a functional baseline can be tested.
